Init_LensFlare: ONE contiguous block for all eight flare sprite info blocks

Scattered-locals class, completing patch 070. asm 0x445c7c-: `mov esi,0x42db60;
lea edi,[ebp-0x104]; mov ecx,0x30; rep movsd` -- the 192-byte template covers
[ebp-0x104..ebp-0x44), i.e. all EIGHT 24-byte Setup_Sprite info blocks
(local_104,local_ec,local_d4,local_bc,local_a4,local_8c,local_74,local_5c);
the following 6-dword copy from 0x42dc20 fills the SUN block (local_44).
Patch 070 sized local_104 to 192 bytes (fixing the crash) but left the other
seven blocks as separate locals gcc never places contiguously -> Setup_Sprite
read garbage screen x/y (measured: FLARE_4 x=-12280 y=-1 vs the reference's
x=128 y=50 in EVERY block) -> flare prims 0x782e60-0x7830e0 got offscreen
coordinates (full-image cf3 diff cluster 0x782eb4-0x7830db vs ref).

